{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_shining_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_shining_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"雨夜","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_shining_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"0aba56c58420cc15b2453c8434b0c3d344074c3369abeaedb5551db6171d3cb0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"逃离赦罪师的闪灵带着夜莺避雨，屋主女儿和她们玩乐甚欢。闪灵击杀了尾随而来的刺客，雨停后带着夜莺离开，与临光擦肩而过。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在外面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我们是路过的雇佣兵，外面雨太大了，想在这里避一会雨，可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你们可以去村里的旅馆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们一会还要赶路，只是借这里暂时避一下雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你还有谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的同伴，她行动不太方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有恶意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"这里不欢迎魔族佬，出去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"一把长剑架在了她的脖子上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想说第二遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请至少......允许我的同伴在屋子里休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你一样，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你是雇佣兵，是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"只许在门旁待着，别到处乱晃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，有客人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不关你的事，回房间去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了，丽兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的运气还算不错，找到了地方休息。再往前走一段路，就能离开维多利亚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要注意休息，好吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，我会的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大姐姐，需要毛巾吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"屋主远远看着女儿走向萨卡兹，不由自主地把手伸向了剑柄。\n但他所担心的事，并没有发生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵接过毛巾，帮夜莺擦干了头发，细心照料一番后，才脱下兜帽，开始擦拭自己那不断滴水的长发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没什么。我只是在想要说什么好......"},{"type":"narration","text":"啾啾。\n一只蓝色的小家伙从夜莺的口袋里钻了出来，落在了她的肩上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，是羽兽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以摸摸它吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜莺抬起手，羽兽就一跳一跳地从她的肩膀来到了指尖上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我第一次见到这么听话的羽兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻~你好呀~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从哪里来呀？"},{"type":"narration","text":"羽兽鸣叫着，像是在回答女孩的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小羽兽小羽兽，想不想玩游戏呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸给我做了好多玩具，但村里的小朋友都不喜欢和我玩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游戏......是什么样的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐你想玩吗？！稍等一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小女孩匆匆跑到了房间里，像是在找什么东西。\n鼓捣一阵后，她拿出了一个小纸箱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这里有很多好玩的，都是爸爸用木头雕出来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最喜欢的是这个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩在箱子里翻找着什么，时不时拿出一两根木块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都散架了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我帮忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要帮我把这样的木块都拿出来，然后三根一排横横竖竖垒起来就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵和女孩一起，从箱子里翻找出木块。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐姐姐，你的角好漂亮啊，你是埃拉菲亚吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，确实，没有毛茸茸的耳朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚我还在房间里的时候，听到姐姐说准备离开维多利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚并不适合我们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵拿起几个刚刚从箱子里找到的木块，将它们一根一根堆叠在一起......\n没叠上几根，眼前的景色便模糊成了一团拥挤的色彩。\n她很久没有待在这样一个充满善意的环境里了，放松下来，困意便一拥而上。\n思绪随着光团在半空中不停地打转......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵已经能够看到出口的光亮了。\n而在她身后的阴影里，堆满了赦罪师卫兵的尸体。\n她没有回头，只是摸了摸绑在自己后背上的夜莺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜莺还没完全苏醒，她只是下意识地紧紧抱住闪灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再忍耐一会，丽兹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们在那儿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走吧，离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也不知道去哪里，丽兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地上或许没有我们的容身之所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (C)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会把你留在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洞窟中的白昼一闪而过，在承重柱和岩石上留下了一道道痕迹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在闪灵走出洞窟前，一只蓝色的羽兽早已迫不及待地飞向阳光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚的声音是从这里传来的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们逃出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟着她们，你去给首领报信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洞口要塌了，快往后退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来、来不及了——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"一声惊呼将闪灵拉回了现实。\n女孩不小心碰倒了几近完成的木塔，木块散落得到处都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不再多休息一会吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......这下得从头再来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就再来一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也......可以帮忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，多一个人就多一份力量嘛！"},{"type":"narration","text":"在三人重新将木塔堆起时，闪灵瞥了一眼屋子的主人。\n他坐在窗边，手里仍拿着那把长剑。\n与之相对，他的孩子正和她们坐在一起，将一些落下的木块划到了夜莺面前，随后继续堆叠木块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就差......最后一根......好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就玩这个吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个游戏很简单的，先投骰子，根据投出的数字抽出相应数字的木块，叠在木塔最上面，谁把木塔弄倒，谁就输啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先投个骰子看看从谁那里开始......"},{"type":"narration","text":"骰子在三人眼前的地面上旋转数次，为众人分出了先后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从我先开始吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜莺拿起骰子，然后任由它从手掌中滑落。\n她用不上太大的力，但好在，这是第一根木块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来到你了，黑色的大姐姐。"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵接过骰子，抛出，落下。\n她看了眼数字，而后转向了木塔。\n取下一根木块并不难，但随着游戏的进行，木塔本身会变得七零八落。\n而曾经的选择与遭遇将层层累积，为未来施加更多的压力。\n闪灵不喜欢这种感觉。\n可规则如此，她也不好拒绝。\n于是，又一根木块叠上了塔顶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......你还好吗，丽兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......没事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经离实验室有些距离了，他们不会再追得那么紧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路还很长，休息一会，吃些东西吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还不饿......"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵翻开行囊，里面只剩下一颗果子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干粮还剩一点，你先吃些水果，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走过前面的桥应该会有村庄，我可以去买些食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，先吃吧，皮已经削干净了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"narration","text":"一踏入村庄，她们周围的惊讶声与窃窃私语就没停过，仿佛她们是闯入村庄的牙兽。\n闪灵却不在意这些，只要一买到干粮，她们就会从这些维多利亚人面前消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面包摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，有什么需......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面包摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族佬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我想买些面包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面包摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"一边去一边去，我不卖面包给魔族佬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"价钱都好说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面包摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，要是收了你的钱，谁还愿意吃我家面包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面包摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"走开走开，后面还有客人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打扰了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵的手按上了剑柄。\n晨曦一闪而过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面包摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"噫！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面包摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"杀、杀人啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请等——"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵很早就注意到了尾随的赦罪师卫兵，她特意避开人多的地方，就是为了少生事端。\n但随着面包摊主大喊着跑向人群，越来越多的人围了过来。\n“魔族佬杀人啦！！”\n“快去找骑警大人！！”\n“村长的儿子不是术师吗，快让他过来！！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"她只想买些果腹的口粮，最后却只能狼狈地逃离村庄。\n背后的同伴在惊慌中紧紧抓着她的衣袍，不停地发抖。\n而在身后的更远处，尖叫与咒骂声持续了很久都没能停歇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闪灵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"narration","text":"回过神来，她们已经坐在一起玩了许久。\n木塔的许多层都只剩下了一根木块，可千疮百孔的木塔仍保持着诡异的平衡。\n过不了多久，胜负就将揭晓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我帮忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能行......让我试试。"},{"type":"narration","text":"那根木块被压得很紧，夜莺每次试图抽动它，都会带着上方众多木块一起移动。\n夜莺和孩子都紧紧盯着那根木块，丝毫没有注意到闪灵与屋主同时站了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像把钱包落在外头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请帮我照顾一下我的同伴，我马上就回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，我们继续吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她尝试了许多次，期望整个木塔的重心能有所变化。\n但那根木块依旧被压得很紧。\n闪灵会怎么做呢？她想了想。\n她记得闪灵会以肉眼看不清的速度抽走木块，木塔甚至都不会因此摇晃。\n她也准备尝试一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加油哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜莺深吸一口气，抓住木块，用力一抽——\n窗外晨曦般的光亮随着木塔的倒下转瞬即逝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶，我赢了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知道为什么，明明赢的只有小女孩，她却抓着夜莺的手手舞足蹈起来，好像这场游戏里，她们两个都是赢家一般。\n纯粹真挚的情感让夜莺死寂的心中泛起了一丝涟漪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你回来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我都看到了，你一剑就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你们也在逃吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵望向窗外，雨渐渐小了，黑夜很好地掩盖了尸体。\n八个赦罪师卫兵，六个来路不明的刺客，两拨不一样的人，找上了同一间屋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以那另外六个人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是来杀我和孩子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你愿意留我们躲雨，也是因为这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是......萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"时间很紧张，我请的护卫还没到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是萨卡兹，那个自傲的贵族是不会雇佣萨卡兹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你看上去有几分实力，所以我想......没想到你们也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我可以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，你帮了我一个大忙。如果你们不急着离开，可以在这里休息一晚上再走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，先生。我们也很想接受你的好意，但我们不能再耽搁一点时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你们路上不方便买口粮吧，我这里还有点面包和肉干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......真的很感谢你，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我得谢谢你们，萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我女儿很久没有那么开心地和人玩耍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她从小就这样，对什么人都没有戒心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一直在逃，一直在搬家，避着人住，她连和人打交道的机会都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这样的日子马上就要结束了，等那个佣兵过来，把她送去亲戚那儿，她就能安定下来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不陪着她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那个该死的贵族杀了我妻子，害得我染病......等孩子安全了，我就要让他付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会逃避的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨停了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (A)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你给我们提供避雨的地方，我想我们也该离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽兹，我们该走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经很晚了，姐姐们不留下来休息吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，有机会的话，下次再来陪你玩，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个送给你们！"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩把两块石头一股脑塞进了闪灵手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我在河边捡到的两块幸运石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸运......石？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，把两块石头敲一敲，就能变得幸运！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我上一次敲的时候，爸爸就带回来一只大羽兽，让我好好吃了一顿呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定，以后姐姐们敲敲石头，还能遇到我哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望真的能有那么一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"再见了，萨卡兹，后会有期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后会有期。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"来了吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好，艾德蒙先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，临光小姐，请进吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这块幸运石给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才还开心吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是觉得......很温暖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被他人重视，被他人关心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能够看着对方将手伸过来，握住它。而不是被刀剑指着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一直能有这样的机会......开心......我想，我会开心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次，我们可以试着在村庄里歇息吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽兹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是所有人都会用善意对待我们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是萨卡兹，你还有矿石病在身。在大多数人眼里，我们是不受欢迎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是因为那户人家的主人恰巧也是一位感染者，我们或许连在屋檐下休息的机会都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但总是有机会的，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们偶尔能治愈别人的痛苦，那我想，偶尔，他人也会为我们行个方便的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使那个概率再小不过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你，闪灵。你的真挚，你的恳切，总有人会回应的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我们走过村庄，我会问问村民；当我们遇上商队，我会问问商人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得做好受人白眼、遭人冷落的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果，运气真在我们这边，说不定，我们会遇到无私帮助我们的人；说不定，在不久的将来，我们能够找到一个能安稳歇息的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"运气的话，我们已经有了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜莺拿出了闪灵交给自己的幸运石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵 (B)","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，是啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵也拿出了自己的那一块。\n两块石头撞到一起，发出了清脆的响声。\n月光照耀下，幸运随身的萨卡兹们离开了维多利亚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
